"""Source-bound provisional integration of the two bottom-outer duties.

This module consumes an already retained WJ-16 or WJ-18 composition. It does
not materialize a family, change source members, or run a native solver. Its
cleats, bores, hardware envelopes, and local collision screens are diagnostic
geometry only; the parent compositor must rebuild shared hosts from raw source
members and the union of native, purchased-panel, and candidate cut maps.
"""

